  },
  "description": "Atlas Data Agent 回合级可观测（Day 51）。口径注记：指标由 observability/otel.py 回合打点（Day 50）；无 LLM 参与时 gen_ai.token_cost 无数据点（不虚报）；时延为回合执行耗时口径（无流式 LLM，TTFT ≈ 回合总时延的近似语义，不做伪细分）。",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "5 分钟回合吞吐（含 clarify/blocked/error/handoff，分母与拒绝率告警一致）",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.2.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(atlas_turn_count_total[5m]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "回合 QPS",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Guard 拒绝回合占比（blocked counter / 回合总量）",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "max": 1,
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.2.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(atlas_turn_blocked_total[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(atlas_turn_count_total[5m])), 0.001)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Guard 拒绝率",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "回合执行时延 p95（ms）。口径：TurnResult.latency_ms（Doris 执行耗时），非端到端全链路——归因细分见 trace span 属性",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.2.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(atlas_turn_latency_milliseconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "回合时延 p95",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "LLM token 累计（单位 token，未接定价表不换算 USD）。确定性链路 0 token：本面板无数据点属正常（如实）",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
